  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/8zKW7GJ\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cbgGrRP/Logo-Decorative-Entities.png\" alt=\"Logo-Decorative-Entities\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">裝飾實體是一個提供多種實體來裝飾你房屋的模組</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新的裝飾實體已於 25/07/29 加入</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xSb7Q8sz/2025-07-29-16-12-20.png\" alt=\"2025-07-29-16-12-20\" width=\"679\" height=\"382\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Y4ntF9th/2025-07-29-16-15-53.png\" alt=\"2025-07-29-16-15-53\" width=\"799\" height=\"450\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要製作裝飾實體，首先需要在工作台上製作框架，然後在石材切割機上使用框架來製作裝飾實體。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>框架合成配方。<br>剝皮杉木原木和玻璃。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DYx4JyX/crafteo2.png\" alt=\"crafteo2\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在石材切割機中製作裝飾實體</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PQFgFjG/004.jpg\" alt=\"004\"></p>",
